  "title": "EP01 Swapped at birth! She returns as a duke’s daughter!  | The Duke’s Lucky Little Heiress",
  "description": "Abandoned in the Dark Forest, she is rescued by the Duchess. Her return brings a miracle—but the imposter posing as the daughter is determined to see her dead… <br><br>Synopsis:<br>Avy, a noble-born daughter gifted with the magic of good fortune, was swapped at birth by her jealous aunt. After enduring relentless abuse, she was abandoned in the Dark Forest at the age of six. By a twist of fate, she was discovered by her own mother and brother, who brought her back to the ducal estate.<br>Facing the schemes of the imposter and her aunt’s malicious slanders—labeling her a &quot;harbinger of disaster&quot;—kind-hearted Avy uses her power to restore life to withered flowers and bring prosperity to the family, gradually winning the hearts of everyone around her. As a crescent-shaped birthmark sparks questions about her true identity, her aunt resorts to poisoning and arson to keep the truth buried. After surviving these life-or-death trials, her family finally recognizes her for who she truly is. The once-abandoned little girl has now become the cherished, beloved daughter of the ducal household.<br><br>🔥Watch the full playlist here:<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLDupy9uQXO0o\">Swapped at birth! She returns as a duke’s ...</a><br><br>💡Recommended popular videos from the channel:<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLVbsk7BPGcgc\">Fell Under The Maestro | Teacher-Student F...</a><br><br>🔔Subscribe &amp; hit the bell to catch the next episode!<br>New episodes uploaded daily. Let us know your thoughts in the comments! 💡<br> <br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/the\">#The</a> Real and the Fake Heiress <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/shortdrama\">#ShortDrama</a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/lucky\">#Lucky</a> Girl<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/duke\">#Duke</a> Romance",
